**Case 3: $n \mid 2011$, so $2013 \bmod n = 2$. Need $n \bmod 3 = 2$.**

Divisors $\ge 2$: $2011$. Since $2011 \bmod 3 = 1 \neq 2$, this fails.

→ **0 values.**

**Verification of all 6 candidates:**
